# Gabugu Platform 顶层 .gitignore —— 防止任何凭据、私钥、数据库导出、本地运维状态进入仓库

# === 凭据、密钥与环境配置 ===
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
!**/.env.template
**/*.env
!platform/deploy/.env.example
**/*.enc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/api_keys.json
**/api_keys.json.*
**/api_keys.*.bak*
**/api_keys.enc
**/provider_presets.json
**/cliproxy.env
**/cliproxy.json
**/*relay*.env
**/secrets.*
**/credentials.*

# === 数据库导出、备份与本地运行时状态 ===
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.bak
**/*.bak.*
**/*.backup
platform/backend/.env.production
platform/backend/backups/
platform/backend/.deploy-state/
platform/backend/data/

# === 私有运维基线与发版现场（放在独立私有运维仓库，严禁混入本代码库） ===
platform/deploy/production-source.json
platform/deploy/source-manifests/
platform/deploy/releases/
platform/deploy/OPS_CHECKLIST*.md
platform/deploy/PRODUCTION_RELEASE_*.md
platform/deploy/PRODUCTION_FRONTEND_RELEASE_*.md
**/private/
**/live-data/

# === 浏览器抓包 / Agent 会话日志 / 临时调试产物 ===
.playwright-cli/
.agent-logs/
.omx/
.grok/
**/edge-profile/
**/harvest_report.json
**/test-results/
**/test-results-*/
platform/frontend/e2e/artifacts/
platform/design-candidates/

# === 日志、缓存与编译产物 ===
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/*.log
**/*.exe
**/audit.json
platform/backend/api_key
platform/backend/base_url*
